itute of Technology (IIT) Delhi.\n \nI’ll be answering questions submitted from across our community as well as the audience here in India....","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102445665912701","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-475","post_id":"475","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102443464973401","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-26","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/475/","text":"We’ve activated Safety Check in response to the earthquake that struck Afghanistan, Pakistan and the surrounding region. The tool is here:...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102443464973401","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-474","post_id":"474","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10102441998207811&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-26","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/474/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-473","post_id":"473","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102440779480151","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-25","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/473/","text":"These are two of my favorite shots from my speech about leading with a mission at Tsinghua.\n\nThis speech was pretty special for me and I'm thinking of making one of these shots my new profile pic....","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102440779480151","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-472","post_id":"472","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102438744947371","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-24","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/472/","text":"We just activated Safety Check in Mexico after Hurricane Patricia struck the coast. We've been following this closely. \n\nIf you're in the area, you'll see a notification that lets you mark yourself...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102438744947371","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-273","post_id":"273","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/vb.4/10102438940151181","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-24","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/273/","text":"I just gave my first ever speech in Chinese at Tsinghua University in Beijing -- on why you need a strong sense of mission to change the world.\n\nThis was also my first real speech in any language...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/vb.4/10102438940151181","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-471","post_id":"471","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10102437263