"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/887/","text":"This is an amazing story about Riza -- a young woman on a small island where the only job for women was collecting seashells, yet she used Internet.org to earn a degree in computer science.\n\nBeing...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102421074005081/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-886","post_id":"886","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102413019800771/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-08","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/886/","text":"Meet the new Reactions.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102413019800771/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-885","post_id":"885","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102412343501081/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-10-08","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/885/","text":"Today we're launching a test of Reactions -- a more expressive Like button. \n\nThe Like button has been a part of Facebook for a long time. Billions of Likes are made every day, and Liking things is a...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102412343501081/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-468","post_id":"468","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10102411135407111&set=a.52923770